Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.87,0:01:02.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪阿姨  我要一个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:02.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aunty Sandy, I want a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好我要带你们两个小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, good thing I'm bringing you two varmints
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.46,0:01:07.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来裤头村唯一做蟹黄堡的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:07.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to the one place in Bikini Bottom that makes 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(655,368)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要十个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want ten Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ten?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你连数到十都不会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't even count to ten
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.01,0:01:14.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:14.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can too
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.84,0:01:15.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:15.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can not
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.63,0:01:16.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:16.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can too
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Simmer down, you two
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.64,0:01:20.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然谁都不准吃蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:20.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or nobody's getting any Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们想吃多少蟹黄堡就给你们多少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll get you kids as many Krabby Patties as you want
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前提是你们不斗嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,long as you don't fight
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.44,0:01:27.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会付钱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:27.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're payin', right?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.60,0:01:28.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然  蓝迪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:28.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, Randy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.27,0:01:31.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们爸爸说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:31.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now your daddy's right
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有和睦相处的人才可以吃蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patties are only for folks who get along
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.49,0:01:40.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你点的就是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:40.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the way you ordered it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别那样跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me that way
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.58,0:01:48.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这蟹黄堡肉饼比五分熟还高一度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:48.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This patty is one degree over medium
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都快烤成焦炭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It may as well be charcoal
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  这片肉饼可完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this patty is perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你答应过我会有奢华大餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You promise me a fancy dinner
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,结果你却带我来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then bring me here
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.47,0:02:02.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很奢华没错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.47,0:02:02.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is fancy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.18,0:02:05.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们这里的纸巾只用过了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:05.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got only once-used napkins
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.02,0:02:09.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是用过两次的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:09.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Twice-used
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.65,0:02:10.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:10.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But that's it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.19,0:02:14.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来扔东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:14.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's throw stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家别急
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold your seahorses, y'all
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.54,0:02:29.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么了断你们的恩怨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:29.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how to settle your scores
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就用德州狂野风
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Texas-style
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我提议来一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I propose a little
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.80,0:02:36.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后院摔跤赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:36.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,backyard wrestling match
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他怎么这么快就搭起来这堆玩意的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How'd he put this all together so fast?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定这主意可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sure this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.01,0:02:43.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:43.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Course
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.81,0:02:46.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用这种办法供大家发泄不满最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:46.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ain't no better way to blow off some steam
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.43,0:02:49.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我还能卖票赚点外快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while I sell tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:49.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to make a little scratch on the side
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.82,0:02:59.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天下午的第一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:02:59.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our first match this afternoon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是奇克斯家双胞胎之间的恩怨对决
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is a grudge match between the Cheeks twins
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.99,0:03:06.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个角落的是混沌小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.99,0:03:06.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In this corner, the chaotic kid
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,外号罗迪的罗迪奇克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Rowdy" Rowdy Cheeks
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个角落的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in this corner
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连午觉都按不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,ya can't pin her down even for a nap
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多动萝丝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rosie "The Wriggler"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.59,0:03:20.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:20.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚轮到谁拿遥控呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whose turn is it with the remote tonight?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.93,0:03:30.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他使出卷尾术  制服了她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:30.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got her in the Tail Twister
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:32.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1110.031,452)}急诊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.10,0:03:33.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手术刀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scalpel
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是痒痒怪物攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a Tickle Monster Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.83,0:03:55.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比分多少
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:55.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the score?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一  二
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,萝丝使出逆转多动反击  击倒了他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rosie rips him with the Reverse Wriggler
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一  二
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.76,0:04:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,three
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.47,0:04:11.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本次斗嘴的获胜者是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:11.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the winner of the argument is
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.02,0:04:12.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,萝丝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:12.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rosie
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.06,0:04:14.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家快来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:14.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Step right up, folks
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.69,0:04:16.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仅限付了钱的客人参加
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:16.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Payin' customers only
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.57,0:04:23.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来是情侣间的斗嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:23.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up next, we got a lovers' quarrel
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.91,0:04:27.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,左边角落的是  亲吻老蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:27.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In the left corner, it's the Krusty Kisser
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,右边角落的是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in the right corner
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,铁气球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Iron Balloon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.08,0:04:39.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别那么认真  我的小阿芙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:39.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be so serious, me little Puffykins
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.05,0:04:42.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可没法对着我这样的脸一直生气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:42.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You could never stay mad at a face like this
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.55,0:04:45.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:45.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.64,0:04:48.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我才要让你变脸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:48.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to rearrange it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你从来没带我去过好地方  尤金
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You never take me anywhere nice, Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我受够你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've had it with you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get back here
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.12,0:05:10.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,观众要跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:10.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're losin' 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.12,0:05:14.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上让选手再度发力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:14.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here comes a second wind
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本轮现在改为阶梯赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This here's now a ladder match
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿个梯子要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do with a ladder?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.84,0:05:21.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换灯泡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:21.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Change a light bulb?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阶梯赛的规则就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The rules of a ladder match are
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.13,0:05:25.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有规则
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:25.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there ain't no rules
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱会伤人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Love hurts
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本次斗嘴的获胜者是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the winner of the argument is
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,铁气球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Iron Balloon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,左边角落的这位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In the left corner
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是统治恶臭的君主苏丹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he's the sultan of stink
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,人称流口水邋遢鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's the Slobbering Slob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,右边角落的这位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in the right corner
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,个头不大  心肠却软
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he's a big softy in a small package
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,娃娃脸宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Babyface Bob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吃过你做的劣质蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've eaten your subpar patties
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.84,0:06:12.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我要吃掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:12.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to eat you
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,辱骂环节
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Insults
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道你有什么问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what your problem is?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.52,0:06:20.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:20.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're too wonderful
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,娃娃脸开场就是一记暴击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Babyface starts out with a strong opening attack
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是一个拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a hug
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朋友之间不必斗嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Friends don't have to fight
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不是你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are not friends
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.00,0:06:43.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,邋遢鬼反击  使出缓慢又疲乏的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:43.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Slob counters with a slow, tired
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.75,0:06:45.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,耳光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:45.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,slap
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.47,0:06:51.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懒鬼继续猛攻  使出一连串肮脏之拳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Slob continues his onslaught
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a flurry of Foul Fists
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再试图使出邋遢抱摔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He goes for a Sloppy Suplex
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.76,0:06:55.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:55.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们摔倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they fell over
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两个都出局
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Both out
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本次斗嘴平手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This argument is a tie
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.25,0:07:30.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,外行耍够了  该顺走我赢的钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:30.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Amateur hour's over, so I'll be taking my winnings
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.39,0:07:34.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:34.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better hurry
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小朋友  该快点开溜了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, kids, time for our quick getaway
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蓝迪奇克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Randy Cheeks
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.32,0:07:49.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你根本不在乎我朋友们能不能和好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:49.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You didn't care about my friends makin' peace
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.03,0:07:52.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只想要他们斗嘴  从中赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:52.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just wanted 'em to fight so you could make some cash
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.95,0:07:58.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就只是个卑鄙肮脏的骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:58.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ain't nothin' but a lowdown dirty cheat
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.37,0:08:04.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我  原子坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:04.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I, the Atomic Varmint
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.67,0:08:12.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  原子坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:12.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I, the Atomic Varmint
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.60,0:08:20.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,向你发起挑战  加赛一场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:20.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,challenge you to a bonus round
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.47,0:08:28.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:28.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight her
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.27,0:08:29.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:29.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被你逮到了  原子坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You caught me, Atomic Varmint
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.03,0:08:32.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我接受你的挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:32.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I accept your challenge
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然我就不叫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or my name ain't
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,勇猛恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,El Daring Diablo
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.12,0:08:42.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:42.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight her
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.29,0:08:47.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拳击擂台上即将开场的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:47.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are coming at you ringside
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.29,0:08:50.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,预计将是一场热闹欢乐的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for what promises to be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a rollicking good time in the ring
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说是吧  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say so, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.09,0:08:54.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:54.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.38,0:08:56.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上进入比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:56.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get right to it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.64,0:09:01.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这两只松鼠一句话不吵  直接开斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No squabbling for these squirrels
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:01.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they dive right into the fight
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.06,0:09:10.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而珊迪  我是说原子坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:10.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Sandy, I mean, The Atomic Varmint
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.02,0:09:12.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,使出了独门绝技  核弹发射
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:12.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,uses her signature Nuclear Launch
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.65,0:09:15.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,勇猛恶魔被打到了围绳边上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:15.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,El Daring Diablo is on the ropes
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又被挂到了她胳膊上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now he's on her arm
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又被抛向了空中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now he's in the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原子坏蛋起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Atomic Varmint blasts off
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.17,0:09:29.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,使出大气层原子分裂拳  冲回地球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And comes back to Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with her Atmospheric Atom Splitter
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但勇猛恶魔逃得掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But will Daring Diablo escape?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原子坏蛋庆祝自己得胜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Atomic Varmint celebrates her victory
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.94,0:09:47.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但别高兴太早
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:47.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But not so fast
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,勇猛恶魔有样秘密武器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,El Daring Diablo has a secret weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(881.083,672)}石油
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.44,0:09:53.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:53.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No fair
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't see nothin'
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.28,0:09:56.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他使出了肮脏手段
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:56.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's fighting dirty
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.07,0:09:57.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是真的脏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:09:57.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Literally
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星上台读秒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's Patrick with the count
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.28,0:10:01.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一  二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:01.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.62,0:10:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,二后面是几
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What comes after two?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.54,0:10:06.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:06.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Three--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要提醒我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好残忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The brutality
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.34,0:10:15.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:15.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight her
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight her
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.59,0:10:17.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:17.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight her
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.05,0:10:23.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真希望我们不必这样斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:23.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wish we didn't have to fight like this
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.06,0:10:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我们不该靠互相摔跤解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe we shouldn't be solving our problems
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by wrestling each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道吗  他说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, he's right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.57,0:10:37.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都应该摔蓝迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:37.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We should all be wrestling Randy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.28,0:10:42.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:42.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.49,0:10:45.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其他摔跤手给原子坏蛋助阵了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:43.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The other wrestlers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:45.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have come to the aid of The Atomic Varmint
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Five?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.09,0:10:55.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以同时对付你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:55.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take all y'all on at once
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十七吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Seventeen?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,勇猛恶魔快输掉了这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,El Daring Diablo is losing this match
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.43,0:11:02.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也快丢了钱包
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:02.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and his wallet
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,八十八吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eighty-eight?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.52,0:11:15.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:15.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hoo, doggie
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.98,0:11:18.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好久没玩得这么开心过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:18.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I haven't had this much fun in ages
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁准备好来斗个第二轮了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, who's ready for round two?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.70,0:11:27.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来如果打不败他们  那就打败他们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:27.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess if you can't beat 'em, beat 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.04,0:11:32.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:32.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.96,0:11:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eleven
