Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝我早安
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning to me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这抹红色调刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A perfect shade of red
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.70,0:12:13.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:13.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.00,0:12:16.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我头上的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:16.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's on my head?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.63,0:12:25.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我头上这个是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:25.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this on my head?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想掺和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get involved
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我头上这个是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this on my head?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.60,0:12:33.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别伤害我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:33.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.81,0:12:34.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:34.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.56,0:12:39.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我头上这个是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:39.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this on my head?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.65,0:12:40.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:40.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.61,0:12:41.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是个小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:41.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just a kid
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.87,0:12:53.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:53.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.83,0:12:56.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:56.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta help me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我头上这个是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this on my head?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来瞧一瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look-see
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's see here
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么特别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing unusual
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在正常范围内
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's within normal range
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.73,0:13:20.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做一下活组织检查
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:20.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just a little biopsy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.82,0:13:28.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:28.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hair
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.58,0:13:31.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:31.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是根头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a hair
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.12,0:13:35.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恭喜你了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:35.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.17,0:13:38.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你长了第一根头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:38.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've grown your first hair
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.13,0:13:39.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一根头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:39.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A hair?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.38,0:13:41.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才一根啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:41.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only one?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是  这头发超级大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, boy, is it a big one
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.13,0:13:46.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:46.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.09,0:13:47.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.09,0:13:47.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't like it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能拿它怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What can I do about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.09,0:13:51.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然就去一下理发店吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:51.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, why not go to the barber shop?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,屠宰店吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Butcher shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.10,注释,,0,0,0,,[ barber（理发）与 butcher（屠宰）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:54.31,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(799,380)}肥油
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差不多是一家屠宰头发的店
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's like a butcher shop for hair
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hurry
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去找头发屠夫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To the hair butcher
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:03.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(847,200)}理发店
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.94,0:14:04.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:04.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.61,0:14:06.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有根超大拐杖糖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:06.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A giant candy cane
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.03,0:14:07.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:07.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.86,0:14:08.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:08.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好难吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This tastes awful
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.65,0:14:44.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  欢迎光临理发店
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:44.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick Star, welcome to the barbershop
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.86,0:14:48.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:48.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为我耳机丢了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I lost those
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My leg
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太神了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Amazing
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.46,0:15:06.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:06.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I'm scared
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.26,0:15:08.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:08.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.22,0:15:11.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,男的都来这里打理形象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:11.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is where guys go to get groomed
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.68,0:15:12.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:12.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又有形象  又很香
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Groomed and perfumed
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.60,0:15:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aaaaa
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,神了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,mazing
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,理完了就奖励一根棒棒糖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll get a lollipop when you're done
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.04,0:15:44.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,任你砍吧  头发屠夫先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:44.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chop away, Mr. Hair Butcher, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要理什么发型
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How would you like it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.92,0:15:47.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,剪掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:47.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Off
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.09,0:15:49.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那简单
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:49.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy enough
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.38,0:15:52.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:52.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的头发是个值得尊敬的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your hair is a worthy adversary
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但还敌不过我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's no match for my
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.33,0:16:19.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五指修剪术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.33,0:16:19.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,five fingers of trim
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.18,0:16:43.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除了剪掉  还可以干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:43.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What can we do besides cutting it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以换个发型
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can style it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我老婆在隔壁有家美容沙龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My wife owns a beauty salon next door
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.61,0:16:49.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:49.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就去换发型
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll get it styled
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就收下那根棒棒糖了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take that lollipop now
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.11,0:16:57.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,头发理不掉  不给棒棒糖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:57.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No cut, no lolly
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.70,0:17:02.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟我的头发好像没听清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:02.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think my hair and I heard you correctly
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.87,0:17:03.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:03.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I said
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想  想带走的都带走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,t-take all you want
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.21,0:17:09.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这才对嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:09.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now we're talkin'
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:14.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468.083,392)}美容店
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.72,0:17:22.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  欢迎光临美容沙龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:22.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick Star, welcome to the beauty salon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.56,0:17:26.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美女们都在这美美地美化自己
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:26.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where beauties get beautified beautifully
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布拉德和维罗妮卡复合了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brad and Veronica are back together?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.95,0:17:36.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:36.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.49,0:17:39.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:39.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.62,0:17:44.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要美美的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:44.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanna be beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是弗洛伦丝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Florence
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.83,0:17:50.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要什么服务吗  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:50.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you, sweeties?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.79,0:17:54.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我搞不定我的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:54.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't do a thing with my hair
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你就来对地方了  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've come to the right place, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.13,0:18:00.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你呢  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:18:00.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what about you, buttercup?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是来护理毛囊的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just here for follicle support
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.56,0:18:06.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么  你想怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:06.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来都不去想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never think
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.06,0:18:11.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就随便试试几个发型吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:11.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, let's try some things
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.86,0:18:15.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开瓶器头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:15.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Corkscrew
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.15,0:18:16.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,曲线板头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:16.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The French Curve
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闪电头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Lightning Bolt
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尖顶装饰头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Finial
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,螺旋防波堤头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Spiral Jetty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.24,0:18:22.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天堂阶梯头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:22.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stairway to Heaven
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分叉发尾头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Split Ends
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无限头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Infinity
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,叉勺头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Spork
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冻酸奶头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Frozen Yogurt
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虫子头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Worm
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.29,0:18:31.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜂巢头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:31.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Beehive
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.34,0:18:35.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要后头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:35.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want the Be Hind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:35.01,注释,,0,0,0,,[ behind（后面）与 beehive（蜂巢）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜂巢头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Beehive
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.55,0:18:39.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,选得好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:39.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excellent choice
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.35,0:18:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你朋友怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to your friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.43,0:18:46.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:46.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.73,0:18:49.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉得我的新发型怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:49.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my new hairdo?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.31,0:18:52.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个叫做后头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:52.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's called The Be Hind
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.61,0:19:02.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的新发型
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:02.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love your new 'do
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走吧  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带出去转转吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's take it out for a spin
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.37,0:19:09.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:09.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So long
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下次再来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come again
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.87,0:19:11.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:11.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice work, honey
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看到你给他弄了个后头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see you gave him The Be Hind
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你快过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come here, you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check him out
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.93,0:19:27.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我朋友的新发型
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:27.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my friend's new 'do
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美不美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.81,0:19:31.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们可是最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.81,0:19:31.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're best friends, y'know
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.60,0:19:33.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:33.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.15,0:19:35.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他头发是精心打理过的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:35.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His hair is coiffed
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他美得让人目眩神迷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got that blinding beauty
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起来后头支持后头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's all get behind The Be Hind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:47.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(501.477,570)}水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.74,0:19:43.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:43.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.66,0:19:47.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们走遍了全镇  炫耀你的新发型
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:45.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've walked all over town
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:47.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,showing off your new hairstyle
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.29,0:19:50.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来可以给你签约模特经纪公司了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:48.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think the next thing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:50.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is to sign you up with a modeling agency
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.87,0:19:51.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:51.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我不拍展览册照片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I won't do catalogs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.64,0:20:08.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:08.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.56,0:20:11.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些可怜的水母蜂失去了巢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:11.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those poor jellybees have lost their hive
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说是不是很惨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't it catastrophic?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.23,0:20:18.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以说是很馋了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:18.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a cat in the tropics, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.83,0:20:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它们在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.08,0:20:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的后头让它们想起了家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your Be Hind reminds them of home
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母酱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.55,0:20:46.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母蜂在报答你给了它们新家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The jellybees are rewarding you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:46.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for giving them a new home
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.22,0:20:49.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真以你为荣  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:49.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am so proud of you, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.06,0:20:55.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:55.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些水母蜂抬起了你的后头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those jellybees are lifting your Be Hind
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这头发还连在我头上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's attached to my head
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.32,0:21:04.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:04.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.57,0:21:05.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:05.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.70,0:21:15.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中士  那是我们火炮训练的目标吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:15.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sarge, is that the target for our cannon practice?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.29,0:21:17.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:17.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.17,0:21:20.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好谨慎行事  把它打下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:20.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better play it safe and blast it down
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.22,0:21:31.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们在朝我们开炮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:31.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're firing at us
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我知道你爱自己的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I know you love your hair
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.89,0:21:36.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你必须要放它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:36.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you're gonna have to let it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.56,0:21:38.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,离去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:38.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,go
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do I do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.73,0:21:45.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许你投入感情  说三遍放开呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:43.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you say the words "let go"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:45.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,three times with a lot of feeling?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.11,0:21:45.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:45.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.15,0:21:49.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:49.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let go
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.37,0:21:56.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了  后头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:56.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Be Hind
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.17,0:21:59.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样才是正确的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:21:59.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was the right thing to do
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.67,0:22:00.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又也许不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:00.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or was it?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.55,0:22:09.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经开始想念我的后头了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:09.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I miss my Be Hind already
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.14,0:22:11.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:11.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.81,0:22:12.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是快看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.81,0:22:12.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But look
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.01,0:22:14.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你经历了那一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:14.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All that experience
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.22,0:22:16.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胸口上又长出一根毛了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.22,0:22:16.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,has put a hair on your chest
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.64,0:22:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你想要这根毛理什么造型  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.64,0:22:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, what were you thinking with this hair, sweetie?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.61,0:22:23.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来都不去想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:23.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never think
